  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asian Development Fund (AsDF 14)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Asian Development Fund (AsDF 14), marking the 13th replenishment since the fund&#x2019;s establishment, will support grant operations during 2025&#x2013;2028. AsDF 14 will prioritise support for the poorest and most vulnerable countries, particularly small island developing states and countries in fragile and conflict-affected situations. It will also provide agile assistance in the event of disasters and emergencies through its crisis response window. AsDF 14 will continue to play a critical role in supporting climate change adaptation and disaster risk reduction, and will enable expanded assistance for regional cooperation and regional public goods, and for transformative gender action. The anticipated substantial increase in operations during the AsDF 14 cycle will be complemented by an expansion in knowledge transfer and capacity development.</narrative>
  </description>
